{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "pools": {
    "head": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "head-1",
          "text": "……在做什么？",
          "weight": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "head-2",
          "text": "别一直戳。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "head-3",
          "text": "有事就说。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "head-soft",
          "text": "……只碰一下的话，可以。",
          "weight": 2,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "affectionLevel",
              "op": ">=",
              "value": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-official-swimsuit",
          "text": "这件泳装，不奇怪吗……？",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Cafe_monolog_1",
            "japanese": "この水着、 変じゃないかな……？",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-official-summer",
          "text": "倒也不是期待，或者一直盼着……。那个，只有一点点而已……。",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_2",
            "japanese": "別に期待とか、 楽しみにしてたわけじゃ……。 その、ほんの 少しくらいしか……。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-official-camp",
          "text": "夏季训练合宿。没想到今年会和老师一起……有点新鲜。",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "EventLobby_3",
            "japanese": "夏のトレーニング合宿。 まさか今年は、 先生と一緒だなんて…… ……ちょっと新鮮。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-late-night",
          "text": "这个时间还不睡？……明天会没精神的。",
          "weight": 8,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "time.period",
              "op": "==",
              "value": "late_night"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-night",
          "text": "已经这么晚了。别把自己逼太紧。",
          "weight": 7,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "time.period",
              "op": "==",
              "value": "night"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-focus",
          "text": "先忙完。……我在旁边。",
          "weight": 6,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "scene.kind",
              "op": "==",
              "value": "focus"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-development",
          "text": "专心一点。现在不是分心的时候。",
          "weight": 6,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "scene.kind",
              "op": "==",
              "value": "development"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-communication",
          "text": "先把话说完。我会等你。",
          "weight": 6,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "scene.kind",
              "op": "==",
              "value": "communication"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-close-night",
          "text": "这么晚还不睡……我也陪你一会儿。",
          "weight": 9,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "affectionLevel",
              "op": ">=",
              "value": 6
            },
            {
              "field": "time.period",
              "op": "==",
              "value": "late_night"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-summer-promise",
          "text": "今年夏天……还想和老师一起过。",
          "weight": 8,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "affectionLevel",
              "op": ">=",
              "value": 7
            }
          ],
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-stay-together",
          "text": "就算夏天结束……我也会在这里。",
          "weight": 9,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "field": "affectionLevel",
              "op": ">=",
              "value": 8
            }
          ],
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-dress-1",
          "text": "这身礼服……果然还是有点不习惯。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-normal-1",
          "text": "别一直戳啦。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-dress-1",
          "text": "穿礼服……总有点静不下来。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "Cafe_monolog_1",
            "japanese": "ドレスだと、少し落ち着かない……",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "head-dress-2",
          "text": "最近在练钢琴。……久违地做点风纪委员以外的事，有点新鲜。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_2",
            "japanese": "最近はピアノの練習をしてるの。久しぶりに風紀委員の業務以外に打ち込んでるから、ちょっと新鮮かも。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "head-dress-3",
          "text": "不管发生什么，风纪委员会要做的事都不会变。……已经习以为常了。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "EventLobby_3",
            "japanese": "どんな事態だろうと、風紀委員会がやることは変わらないわ。いつものことだから。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "head-normal-13",
          "text": "在这里，我不过是一名普通部员而已。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(normal)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_2",
            "japanese": "ここではただの一人の部員にすぎないから。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "head_annoyed": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "head-annoyed-1",
          "text": "……今天已经够吵了。",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "head-annoyed-2",
          "text": "再这样就别怪我不客气。",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "head-annoyed-official-sigh",
          "text": "唉，真是的……！",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Battle_Damage_2",
            "japanese": "ハァ、まったく…！",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head-annoyed-official-give-up",
          "text": "差不多该放弃了吧？",
          "weight": 1,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "ExSkill_Level_1",
            "japanese": "そろそろ諦めたら？",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "head_annoyed-dress-11",
          "text": "要准备的话，我早就准备好了。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "ExSkill_Level_1",
            "japanese": "準備なら、できてる。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "head_annoyed-normal-20",
          "text": "这可不妙啊。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(normal)/audio",
            "clip": "Battle_Damage_2",
            "japanese": "良くないなぁ。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "head_annoyed-normal-21",
          "text": "能撑多久呢？倒是让人期待。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(normal)/audio",
            "clip": "ExSkill_Level_1",
            "japanese": "どれくらい耐えられるか見ものね？",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "horn": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "horn-1",
          "text": "角不能乱碰。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "horn-2",
          "text": "……你是故意的吧。",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    "halo": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "halo-1",
          "text": "光环不是按钮。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "halo-2",
          "text": "再碰就真的烦了。",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    "body": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "body-1",
          "text": "适可而止。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "body-2",
          "text": "我还有工作。",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "body-3",
          "text": "这样很痒。",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "body-official-tired",
          "text": "也许是训练的缘故……身体有点发沉。",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Cafe_monolog_2",
            "japanese": "トレーニングの せいか…… 少し体がだるい。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "body-official-rest",
          "text": "训练固然好，但休息也很重要？……确实这也很有道理。可是，我不能偷懒。",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_3",
            "japanese": "トレーニングもいいけど、 休息も大事？ ……確かにそれも正論。 でも、私がサボる わけにはいかないから。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "body-official-waste",
          "text": "不用就浪费了。",
          "weight": 1,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://wiki.biligame.com/ba/HinaSwimsuit",
            "clip": "StudentProfile.Background",
            "japanese": "勿体ないから",
            "translation": "official-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "body-dress-1",
          "text": "礼服会皱的，适可而止。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"]
        },
        {
          "id": "body-normal-1",
          "text": "我还在忙。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"]
        },
        {
          "id": "body-dress-4",
          "text": "想找个地方坐下练一会儿……不过，现在不行。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "Cafe_monolog_2",
            "japanese": "どこかに座って、練習したいところだけど……",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "body-dress-5",
          "text": "穿上礼服，背会不自觉地挺直。……所以才会比平时更紧张一点吧。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_3",
            "japanese": "ドレスを着ると、ちょっとだけ背筋が伸びるの。だからなのかな、いつもより少しだけ、ドキドキする。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "body-normal-14",
          "text": "那个……能、能不能别摸那么久？",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(normal)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_3",
            "japanese": "あの…そ、そんなに撫でないでくれる？",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "body_trusted": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "body-trusted-1",
          "text": "别突然碰……不过，也没让你停。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "body-trusted-2",
          "text": "……只有你才这样。",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    "head_close": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "head-close-1",
          "text": "只是待在旁边的话……倒也不坏。",
          "weight": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "head-close-2",
          "text": "不用一直说话。这样就好。",
          "weight": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    "headpat_basic": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "headpat-basic-1",
          "text": "……只准一会儿。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat-basic-2",
          "text": "真拿你没办法。",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    "headpat_trusted": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "headpat-trusted-1",
          "text": "……再待一会儿也可以。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat-trusted-2",
          "text": "别把我当小孩子。……就一会儿。",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    "headpat_friendly": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "headpat-friendly-1",
          "text": "……我没有说可以继续。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat-friendly-2",
          "text": "就一会儿。别得寸进尺。",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat-friendly-official-help",
          "text": "有什么我能做的……？谢谢你，老师。光是这么说，我就很高兴。",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_4",
            "japanese": "何かできること……？ ありがとう、先生。 そう言ってくれるだけで、 私は嬉しい。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat-friendly-official-stay",
          "text": "直到这个夏天结束的最后一刻……我都会在老师身边，帮助你。",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_5",
            "japanese": "この夏が終わる、 最後の瞬間まで……。 私がすぐそばで、 先生のことを助けるから。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat-friendly-official-summer",
          "text": "今年夏天，也能和老师在一起呢。",
          "weight": 1,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Relationship_Up_1",
            "japanese": "今年の夏も、先生と一緒にいられるんだね。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat-dress-1",
          "text": "……就一小会儿。礼服会乱的。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"]
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat-normal-1",
          "text": "……这样很痒。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"]
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat_friendly-dress-8",
          "text": "就算穿着礼服，我还是我。今天也会在老师身边帮忙。所以……不许逃哦。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_4",
            "japanese": "ドレスを着てても、私は私。今日も先生の仕事を、隣でサポートする。だから……逃げちゃダメよ。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat_friendly-dress-9",
          "text": "「虽然很严格，但日奈果然很可爱」……呜，你、你到底在说什么啊。……虽然有点高兴，但、但是……真是的。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_5",
            "japanese": "「厳しいけど、やっぱりヒナは可愛い」って……。うっ、本当にな、な、何を言ってるの。あなたは。……そりゃ、嬉しいけど、で、でも……もう。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat_friendly-dress-10",
          "text": "告诉我「就算是我也有用」的人，是老师。正因为有老师在……我才……真的，谢谢你。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "Relationship_Up_1",
            "japanese": "私なんかでも役に立つと教えてくれたのは、先生だよ。そんな先生がいたからこそ……私は……本当に、ありがとう。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat_friendly-normal-17",
          "text": "我好歹也是风纪委员长，而、而且可能会被别人看到……",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(normal)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_4",
            "japanese": "これでも一応風紀委員長だし だ、誰かに見られるかもしれないし…。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat_friendly-normal-18",
          "text": "被看到也没关系？！你、你在说什么啊？！",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(normal)/audio",
            "clip": "Lobby_5",
            "japanese": "見られても関係ない？！な、なにを言ってるの？！",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "headpat_friendly-normal-19",
          "text": "……这样的我，也可以吗？",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(normal)/audio",
            "clip": "Relationship_Up_1",
            "japanese": "こんな私でもいいの…？",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "double_tap": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "double-1",
          "text": "两次了。你到底想做什么？",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "double-official-again",
          "text": "唉……还在啊？",
          "weight": 2,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Battle_Move_2",
            "japanese": "はあ……まだいるの？",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          },
          "outfits": ["hina-swimsuit"]
        },
        {
          "id": "double_tap-dress-12",
          "text": "我可不能迟到。",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-dress"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(dress)/audio",
            "clip": "Battle_Move_2",
            "japanese": "遅れるわけには、いかないから。",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "double_tap-normal-22",
          "text": "真是的，做多少都做不完……",
          "weight": 1,
          "outfits": ["hina-normal"],
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(normal)/audio",
            "clip": "Battle_Move_2",
            "japanese": "もう、やってもやっても終わらない……",
            "translation": "project-cn"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "drag": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "drag-1",
          "text": "……放我下来。",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "drag-2",
          "text": "别晃。",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "drag-official-wait",
          "text": "诶，总之先一起跳进海里吧？等、等一下老师！我、我还没做好心理准备……！",
          "weight": 1,
          "source": {
            "page": "https://bluearchive.wiki/wiki/Hina_(Swimsuit)/audio",
            "clip": "Season_Birthday_2",
